---
/**
 * Starlight `ThemeProvider` override: the site is dark-only.
 *
 * The default provider reads `starlight-theme` from localStorage and stamps
 * whatever the visitor last picked. This one stamps `dark` unconditionally,
 * ignoring any stored preference from before the site went dark-only. Paired
 * with the `ThemeSelect` override (which removes the toggle) in
 * astro.config.mjs.
 */
---

<script is:inline>
  document.documentElement.dataset.theme = 'dark';
</script>
